---
layout: "base.webc"
title: "2016 October"
id: "201610"
poemTitle: "October Flashbacks"
author: "Eila Webster"
bgTheme: "antiquewhite"
endOfYear: false
---

<div class="full-width">
  <poem-grid :title="poemTitle" :author="author" :theme="bgTheme">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-9.avif" alt="" slot="header-tl" />
    <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-1.avif" alt="" slot="header-tr" />

    <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-1-images">
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-10.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-8.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-4.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 Text -->
    <div slot="col-2-text">
      <p>
        I can’t believe this is October, <br />
        We’re in mid-Autumn once again; <br />
        Oh! How quickly time has flown, <br />
        Since I took up my pen.
      </p>

      <p>
        To herald in a bright New Year, <br />
        With possibilities that caught attention; <br />
        Better get your skates on quick, <br />
        Before you are on the pension.
      </p>

      <p>
        Don’t leave it for retiral years, <br />
        That’s classed as a bed of roses; <br />
        Nobody mentions the many thorns, <br />
        And failing energy in small doses.
      </p>

      <p>
        Do the things you wish for Now, <br />
        Not on some far off future date; <br />
        Go on! Start to tick them off, <br />
        ‘til you clean up the slate.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
    <div slot="col-3-images">
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-0.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-6.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-3.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4 Text -->
    <div slot="col-4-text">
      <p>
        You’ll get a glow of satisfaction, <br />
        And life will be a lot more fun; <br />
        You’ll be storing up sweet memories, <br />
        Wage earning jobs will still get done.
      </p>

      <p>
        Although this is a busy time, <br />
        If you have a large garden plot; <br />
        Earthing up carrots, neeps and leeks, <br />
        Storing tatties for the soup pot!
      </p>

      <p>
        In the changing tapestry of life, <br />
        Each month has a role to play; <br />
        Keep looking for all the benefits, <br />
        You could find along the way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-5-images">
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-5.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-9.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2016-october/image-11.avif" alt="" />
    </div>
  </poem-grid>
</div>
